WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:04,367
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,467 --> 00:00:06,184
This is Episode 41.

3
00:00:06,284 --> 00:00:07,730
Sammy is locked.

4
00:00:07,830 --> 00:00:09,095
A toy is gone.

5
00:00:09,195 --> 00:00:09,845
Oh no!

6
00:00:09,945 --> 00:00:10,849
Maya tugs.

7
00:00:10,949 --> 00:00:11,671
Nothing.

8
00:00:11,771 --> 00:00:13,759
Then a lantern blinks.

9
00:00:13,859 --> 00:00:16,480
Something is wrong right now.

10
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:19,020
Stones light up behind him.

11
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:22,102
They remember who opened the lid.

12
00:00:22,202 --> 00:00:24,913
A frame holds the right clasp.

13
00:00:25,013 --> 00:00:27,633
Sammy's clasp does not match.

14
00:00:27,733 --> 00:00:29,992
A glass follows one path.

15
00:00:30,092 --> 00:00:32,532
The toy is under the bench.

16
00:00:32,632 --> 00:00:34,168
Maya picks it up.

17
00:00:34,268 --> 00:00:34,918
Click!

18
00:00:35,018 --> 00:00:37,006
The clasp is straight.

19
00:00:37,106 --> 00:00:39,185
The lantern glows calm.

20
00:00:39,285 --> 00:00:40,730
Watch right now.

21
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:42,638
Remember who did it.

22
00:00:42,738 --> 00:00:44,184
Check the match.

23
00:00:44,284 --> 00:00:45,729
Follow one path.

24
00:00:45,829 --> 00:00:47,908
That is the watchtower.

25
00:00:48,008 --> 00:00:52,978
Now you know CloudWatch, CloudTrail, Config, and X-Ray!

26
00:00:53,078 --> 00:00:57,777
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

